# Contributor agent skills. Tools like `btw` or `library-skills` may install
# dependency skills into .agents/skills/ (and, via the .claude/skills symlink,
# Claude-targeted installs land there too), so only the skills listed here are
# tracked. Update this list when adding or removing a skill.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/memory-bank/
